{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "email-notification-backend-v2",
    "name": "Email Notification Backend",
    "description": "Coleção de endpoints da API Email Notification Backend.\n\n## Como usar\n1. Importe este arquivo no Postman\n2. Importe o environment `email-notification-backend.postman_environment.json`\n3. Selecione o environment `Email Notification Backend - Local`\n4. Execute `POST Create User` primeiro — o `publicId` é capturado automaticamente na variável de coleção `publicId`\n\n## Base URL\n- Docker (padrão): `http://localhost:8081`\n- bootRun local: `http://localhost:8080`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "publicId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID público do último usuário criado. Preenchido automaticamente pelo script de teste de POST /users."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Infrastructure",
      "description": "Endpoints de infraestrutura (Actuator).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["actuator", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica se a aplicação está saudável e conectada ao banco."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 UP",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"UP\",\n  \"components\": {\n    \"db\": {\n      \"status\": \"UP\",\n      \"details\": {\n        \"database\": \"PostgreSQL\",\n        \"validationQuery\": \"isValid()\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"diskSpace\": { \"status\": \"UP\" },\n    \"ping\": { \"status\": \"UP\" }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "CRUD de usuários. Todos os endpoints usam `publicId` (UUID) como identificador público — o `id` interno (BIGINT) nunca é exposto.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('publicId', body.publicId);",
                  "    console.log('publicId captured:', body.publicId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Response has publicId', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.publicId).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.publicId).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Status is ACTIVE', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.equal('ACTIVE');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Cria um novo usuário com status `ACTIVE`.\n\nApós criação bem-sucedida, o `publicId` retornado é salvo automaticamente na variável de coleção `{{publicId}}`.\n\n**Validações**:\n- `name`: obrigatório, máx 255 chars\n- `email`: obrigatório, formato válido, único, máx 255 chars"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"publicId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Validation Error (blank name)",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"name: Name is required\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Validation Error (invalid email)",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"not-an-email\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"email: Invalid e-mail format\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 Email Already Exists",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 409,\n  \"error\": \"Conflict\",\n  \"message\": \"Email already registered: alice@example.com\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List Users",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Response is array', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('No DELETED users in list', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    body.forEach(user => {",
                  "        pm.expect(user.status).to.not.equal('DELETED');",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos os usuários não deletados (`ACTIVE` e `INACTIVE`).\n\nUsuários com status `DELETED` (soft-delete) são excluídos da lista."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – lista com usuários",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"publicId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n    \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n    \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"publicId\": \"b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901\",\n    \"name\": \"Bob Santos\",\n    \"email\": \"bob@example.com\",\n    \"status\": \"INACTIVE\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T09:00:00\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T11:00:00\"\n  }\n]"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK – lista vazia",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "[]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('publicId matches requested', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.publicId).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get('publicId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/{{publicId}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{publicId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna um usuário pelo `publicId` (UUID).\n\n**Variável `{{publicId}}`**: preenchida automaticamente após `Create User`, ou informe manualmente.\n\n**Erros**:\n- `404` se o usuário não existir"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"publicId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["users", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 404,\n  \"error\": \"Not Found\",\n  \"message\": \"User not found: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Deactivate User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Status is INACTIVE', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.equal('INACTIVE');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/{{publicId}}/deactivate",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{publicId}}", "deactivate"]
            },
            "description": "Transiciona o usuário de `ACTIVE` para `INACTIVE`.\n\nRetorna o estado final do usuário.\n\n**Erros**:\n- `404` se o usuário não existir\n- `422` se o usuário já estiver `INACTIVE` ou `DELETED`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – INACTIVE",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"publicId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"status\": \"INACTIVE\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T11:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 404,\n  \"error\": \"Not Found\",\n  \"message\": \"User not found: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 Already INACTIVE",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 422,\n  \"error\": \"Unprocessable Entity\",\n  \"message\": \"User is not active\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Status is DELETED', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.equal('DELETED');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/{{publicId}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{publicId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Soft-delete do usuário (`ACTIVE` ou `INACTIVE` → `DELETED`).\n\nRetorna o estado final com `status: DELETED`. O registro não é removido do banco.\n\n**Erros**:\n- `404` se o usuário não existir\n- `422` se o usuário já estiver `DELETED`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – DELETED",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"publicId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"status\": \"DELETED\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-14T12:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 404,\n  \"error\": \"Not Found\",\n  \"message\": \"User not found: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 Already DELETED",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": 422,\n  \"error\": \"Unprocessable Entity\",\n  \"message\": \"User is already deleted\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

